ed", "source": "Eiffel Tower Set Ablaze by Terrorists | Snopes.com https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/eiffel-tower-terrorist-attack/", "supported": [{"part": "发生在尼斯的恐怖袭击", "quote": "Just after a devastating attack in Nice, France, on 14 July 2016 — in which dozens of people were killed and still more wounded when a man identified as French-Tunisian drove a huge truck through a large crowd watching fireworks", "verified": true, "hint": null}, {"part": "同期", "quote": "Just after a devastating attack in Nice, France, on 14 July 2016", "verified": true, "hint": null}, {"part": "巴黎这起火灾", "quote": "An accidental truck fire took place at Jena Bridge.", "verified": true, "hint": null}, {"part": "应予区分", "quote": "the result of an accidental explosion of fireworks being trucked across the nearby Jena Bridge", "verified": true, "hint": null}], "contradicted": [], "rejected": [], "source_reports_claim": false, "statement_asserts_fact": true, "scope_overreach": false, "is_image": false, "notes": "来源明确将尼斯事件描述为\"devastating attack\"，巴黎事件描述为\"accidental truck fire\"，二者性质不同，支持\"应予区分\"的论断；待核句称尼斯事件为\"恐怖袭击\"，来源用词为\"attack\"，未显式使用\"terrorist\"一词，但语境（反恐背景、卡车冲撞人群）与恐怖袭击一致，视为基本支持。"}, {"finding_id": "A4", "evidence_id": "E22", "verdict": "supported", "source": "Fire near Eiffel Tower an accidental blaze quickly put out, not connected to Nice attack – New York Daily News https://www.nydailynews.com/2016/07/14/fire-near-eiffel-tower-an-accidental-blaze-quickly-put-out-not-connected-to-nice-attack/", "supported": [{"part": "同期发生在尼斯的恐怖袭击", "quote": "just as an attack killed [as many as 73 Bastille Day revelers](http://www.nydailynews.com/news/world/truck-crashes-crowd-bastille-day-celebration-france-article-1.2712028) in the French Riviera capital of Nice", "verified": true, "hint": null}, {"part": "巴黎这起火灾", "quote": "A truck carrying fireworks caught fire next to the Eiffel Tower in Paris", "verified": true, "hint": null}], "contradicted": [], "rejected": [{"part": "应予区分", "quote": "not connected to Nice attack", "verified": false, "hint": null}], "source_reports_claim": false, "statement_asserts_fact": true, "scope_overreach": false, "is_image": false, "notes": "来源标题和正文均明确指出巴黎火灾与尼斯袭击无关，且两事件发生在同一时间，完全支持待核句。"}, {"finding_id": "A5", "evidence_id": "E11", "verdict": "supported", "source": "Eiffel Tower Set Ablaze by Terrorists | Snopes.com https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/eiffel-tower-terrorist-attack/", "supported": [{"part": "相关火情影像", "quote": "photos and video of the event", "verified": true, "hint": null}, {"part": "被误传为", "quote": "misleadingly presenting them as", "verified": true, "hint": null}, {"part": "巴黎遭袭的证据", "quote": "must have thought Paris itself was under attack", "verified": true, "hint": null}, {"part": "巴黎遭袭的证据", "quote": "misleadingly presenting them as \"evidence\" that the entire country was under coordinated attack", "verified": true, "hint": null}], "contradicted": [], "rejected": [], "source_reports_claim": false, "statement_asserts_fact": true, "scope_overreach": false, "is_image": false, "notes": "来源[3]用词是\"the entire country was under coordinated attack\"，比待核句的\"巴黎遭袭\"范围略大，但来源[2]也明确提到\"Paris itself was under attack\"，两者均可支持待核句表述。"}, {"finding_id": "A5", "evidence_id": "E22", "verdict": "supported", "source": "Fire near Eiffel Tower an accidental blaze quickly put out, not connected to Nice attack – New York Daily News https://www.nydailynews.com/2016/07/14/fire-near-eiffel-tower-an-accidental-blaze-quickly-put-out-not-connected-to-nice-attack/", "supported": [{"part": "相关火情影像", "quote": "A Video posted on YouTube showed clouds of black smoke from the blaze surrounding the world-famous tower.", "verified": true, "hint": null}, {"part": "被误传为巴黎遭袭的证据", "quote": "talk circulating online that the landmark had caught fire as part of an attack on both cities", "verified": true, "hint": null}], "contradicted": [], "rejected": [], "source_reports_claim": false, "statement_asserts_fact": true, "scope_overreach": false, "is_image": false, "